      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i've hit it. the ceiling. everything i've made lately just feels like a cheap imitation of what i was capable of a few years ago. it's like the spark is just... gone. and the worst part is knowing that i'll never get back to that place. i'm just watching myself fade away.",
