    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not a \"phase.\" i can feel it in my bones. the talent isn't just sleeping, it's actually dead. if i keep trying to make things, i'm just making garbage. it's painful to see someone who used to be great just... becoming a parody of themselves. i'd rather just walk away from everything right now while people still remember me as someone who mattered, instead of staying until i'm just a joke.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
