      "content": "it just feels so much more dignified to go out on top. i've spent my whole life building this identity, and if i let it crumble into something pathetic, i lose everything. there's no way to fix this. wouldn't it be better to just end the story here while it's still beautiful, rather than letting the decay continue until there's nothing left to save?",
